---
title: Beaufort cipher
tags: tools
---
{% from "macros/tool.njk" import toolSection with context %}
{% set filename = page.fileSlug %}
{% set intro %}
<p class="px-2">
    Similar to the Vigenère cipher (the decryption process is the same), except you start with a reversed alphabet. For example: <code class="d-inline-flex px-2 bg-success bg-opacity-10 border border-success border-opacity-10 rounded-2">Hello</code> encrypted with a key of <code class="d-inline-flex px-2 bg-success bg-opacity-10 border border-success border-opacity-10 rounded-2">Test</code> would shift like: 
    <code class="d-inline-flex px-2 bg-success bg-opacity-10 border border-success border-opacity-10 rounded-2">
        H &srarr; T &srarr; M
    </code> 
    <code class="d-inline-flex px-2 bg-success bg-opacity-10 border border-success border-opacity-10 rounded-2">
        e &srarr; e &srarr; a
    </code>
    <code class="d-inline-flex px-2 bg-success bg-opacity-10 border border-success border-opacity-10 rounded-2">
        l &srarr; s &srarr; h
    </code> 
    <code class="d-inline-flex px-2 bg-success bg-opacity-10 border border-success border-opacity-10 rounded-2">
        l &srarr; t &srarr; i
    </code>
    - then loop back and start from the first letter in the key again. There is more information available on the <a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Beaufort_cipher" class="text-convrtr">Beaufort cipher</a> Wikipedia page. 
</p>
{% endset %}
{% call toolSection(intro) %}
<div class="col">
    <div class="card">
        <span class="card-label visually-hidden">{{ filename | capitalize }} cipher</span>
        <div class="card-body text-center">
            <label for="{{ filename }}Text" class="visually-hidden">Beaufort encrypt/decrypt string</label>
            <textarea placeholder="Example: Hello &srarr; Test [key] &srarr; Mahif" rows="6" id="{{ filename }}Text" class="form-control {{ filename }}-cipher" autocomplete="off"></textarea>
        </div>
        <div class="card-footer py-3">
            <div class="text-center mb-4 g-0">
                <div class="row row-cols-2 g-md-0 gx-0 gy-2">
                    <div class="col col-12 col-md-auto">
                        <div class="input-group w-auto">
                            <label class="input-group-text" id="{{ filename }}KeyLabel" for="{{ filename }}Key"><span class="visually-hidden">{{ filename }} </span>Key</label>
                            <input type="text" class="form-control" id="{{ filename }}Key" autocomplete="off">
                            <button class="btn btn-convrtr" type="button" id="{{ filename }}Encrypt">Encrypt</button>
                            <button class="btn btn-outline-convrtr" type="button" id="{{ filename }}Decrypt">Decrypt</button>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="col d-flex flex-fill justify-content-end">
                        {% include "components/select-copy-dl.njk" %}
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
            <hr />
            <div id="{{ filename }}Results" class="data-to-copy active convrtr-results"></div>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>
{% endcall %}
